ent?id=nFtmEAAAQBAJ&amp;printsec=frontcover&amp;img=1&amp;zoom=5&amp;edge=curl&amp;source=gbs_api\" alt=\"Love Unlocked\" width=\"140\" height=\"200\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between flex-1 p-2\">\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-semibold dark:text-white line-clamp-2\">Love Unlocked</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 line-clamp-3\">Young and dreamy, Priyanka wants to break free from her middle class life to live in the lap of luxury. She is longing for a partner who can pamper her by giving a comfortable life. Sincere and practical, Varun is looking for a companion who can accept and embrace his family.</p>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">-Kavita Bhatnagar</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-2 dark:text-gray-300 flex-wrap\">\n            <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 border rounded dark:border-gray-700\" aria-label=\"Buy on Amazon for 500₹\">\n              <img src=\"https://www.svgrepo.com/show/349584/amazon.svg\" class=\"w-5 h-5\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n              <span>500₹</span>\n            </a>\n            <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 border rounded dark:border-gray-700\" aria-label=\"Buy on Flipkart for 232₹\">\n              <img src=\"https://www.svgrepo.com/show/162476/flipkart.svg\" class=\"w-5 h-5\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n              <span>232₹</span>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
